                "content": "Product behavior (page views, product views, clicks, cart, search, checkout funnel) now lives in **PostHog**, not here — see `src/lib/observability/README.md`. This dashboard is engineering health only.\n\n**How this dashboard reads Faro data**\n\nFaro telemetry is stored in your **Grafana Cloud Logs** Loki data source. Grafana Cloud promotes the Faro attributes `app_id`, `kind` (and `app_key`) to **labels** — there is no `app` label. Queries therefore select `{app_id=~\"$app_id\", kind=\"measurement\"}`.\n\n**If panels show “No data”:**\n1. Set the **Loki** data source to the `-logs` instance (name ends in `-logs`), not `…-usage-insights`.\n2. Pick your app in the **Faro app id** dropdown (All is fine). If it is empty, run `{kind=\"measurement\"}` in Explore — no results means frontend telemetry is not reaching this stack (check the collector URL / redeploy).\n3. Verify fields parse: `{kind=\"measurement\"} | logfmt` should return web-vitals lines.\n\nThe **Server (Tempo)** row needs server-side OTLP env vars (`OTEL_*`) deployed; it stays empty until then.",
                "mode": "markdown"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
